{{define "formulas"}}
{{$l := .Lang}}{{$ex := .Examples}}

<section class="band">
  <h2>{{if eq $l "id"}}Setiap rumus di halaman ini benar-benar dijalankan{{else}}Every formula on this page is actually executed{{end}}</h2>
  <p class="section-intro">
    {{if eq $l "id"}}Ini bukan ringkasan buku teks. Setiap rumus di bawah adalah dokumentasi dari kode Go yang berjalan di <code>internal/</code>, dan kolom contoh hitungnya disuntikkan dari angka yang benar-benar dihitung engine pada tanggal data {{date .Analysis.StatusDate $l}}. Kalau data proyek diubah, contohnya ikut berubah - sehingga halaman ini tidak akan pernah memuat angka yang berbeda dari halaman analisisnya.{{else}}This is not a textbook summary. Each formula below documents Go code running in <code>internal/</code>, and its worked example is injected from figures the engine genuinely computes at data date {{date .Analysis.StatusDate $l}}. Change the project data and the examples change with it - so this page can never carry numbers that differ from the analysis pages.{{end}}
  </p>
  <nav class="toc">
    {{range formulaGroups}}
    <a href="#g-{{.Key}}">{{tx .Name $l}}</a>
    {{end}}
  </nav>
</section>

{{range formulaGroups}}
{{$g := .}}
<section class="band" id="g-{{.Key}}">
  <h2>{{tx .Name $l}}</h2>
  <p class="section-intro">{{tx .Desc $l}}</p>

  {{range formulasIn $g.Key}}
  {{$f := .}}
  <article class="formula-card">
    <header>
      <h3>{{tx .Name $l}}</h3>
      <a class="formula-route" href="{{$.BaseURL}}{{pathFor .Route $l}}">{{if eq $l "id"}}dipakai di{{else}}used on{{end}} {{.Route}} →</a>
    </header>

    <pre class="notation"><code>{{tx .Notation $l}}</code></pre>

    <div class="formula-body">
      <div class="symbols">
        <h4>{{if eq $l "id"}}Simbol{{else}}Symbols{{end}}</h4>
        <dl>
          {{range .Symbols}}
          <dt><code>{{.Sym}}</code></dt>
          <dd>{{tx .Desc $l}}</dd>
          {{end}}
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="explain">
        <h4>{{t $l "t.meaning"}}</h4>
        <p>{{tx .Meaning $l}}</p>
        <h4>{{t $l "t.reading"}}</h4>
        <p>{{tx .Reading $l}}</p>
        <h4 class="pitfall-head">{{if eq $l "id"}}Jebakan{{else}}Pitfall{{end}}</h4>
        <p class="pitfall">{{tx .Pitfall $l}}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {{$e := index $ex $f.Key}}
    {{if $e.Substitution}}
    <div class="worked-example">
      <h4>{{t $l "t.example"}}</h4>
      <pre><code>{{$e.Substitution}}</code></pre>
      <p class="result"><strong>{{$e.Result}}</strong></p>
      <p class="comment">{{tx $e.Comment $l}}</p>
    </div>
    {{end}}

    <p class="formula-source">{{t $l "t.source"}}: {{tx .Source $l}}</p>
  </article>
  {{end}}
</section>
{{end}}
{{end}}
